{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cut for Stories 是一款專為 Instagram 限時動態而設的相片編輯 App，提供多款限時動態範本、背景與文字工具，讓你把相片排成理想版面再分享。適合喜歡在社交平台分享生活點滴、又想做出個人風格的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-20.webp\">\n<h2>範本特效與文字排版</h2>\n<p>匯入相片後套用限時動態範本，可做出寶麗來、舊相機等復古效果，並以編輯工具微調亮度與對比。想加入想法或引言，可選用多款特別字體及自訂文字顏色，更支援多段文字。裁剪相片後一按即可切換模糊或純色背景，完成後儲存至相簿或直接發佈至 Instagram。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-405-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-406-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-407-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-408-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-409-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-410-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cut for Stories</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:39:40.363726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:58:09.223684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:37:44.638960+00:00","content_hash":"c865b45d76ef2028d0d1ea66bc9e80809e6056bbade56706322b21e3853b75a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}